STR_GRF_NAME            :Modern Tycoon Space Industry (development preview)
STR_GRF_DESC            :{ORANGE}Modern Tycoon Space Industry{}{BLACK}A new industry chain: oil becomes rocket fuel, the spaceport launches rockets to the asteroid belt and lands them again full of asteroid ore, and the asteroid refinery turns the ore into goods. All buildings and animations are procedurally drawn. Development preview.{}{}License: GPL v2
STR_GRF_URL             :https://github.com/justaride/modern-tycoon
STR_ERR_TOYLAND         :Modern Tycoon Space Industry needs oil and goods, which the toyland climate does not have.

